WEBVTT

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.960
My son hasn't come home yet.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.220
He was seen going toward Castle Draluc...

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.840
Draluc...

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.850
He's feared as a progenitor
and an invincible vampire.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:25.230
Please, save my son,
Vampire Hunter Ronaldo the Great!

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.940
Leave it to me.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.320
"Vampire Hunter - Ronaldo"

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.450
Invincible progenitor, huh?

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.620
It'll be a nice addition to my titles
if I hunt that down.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.290
Now, come out, Draluc!

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.670
Today is your--

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.380
Sand...

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:52.420
What?!

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:23.810
"The Hunter Comes and Flies in the Sky"

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.220
"The Hunter Comes and Flies in the Sky"
Sand...

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:29.600
The progenitor and
invincible vampire, Draluc...

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:30.900
Wait, you're kidding, right?

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.860
What's with the edge of this door?
Does it have some sort of holy power?

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.400
What?! He can revive himself!

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.950
You got me, you lowly human.

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.450
I just opened the door, though.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:45.740
I commend you for your courage
in coming to this castle alone.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:49.410
