Did you commit this act of violence

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:52.460
knowing that I am the progenitor
and invincible vampire, Draluc?

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.380
That's right! I, Vampire Hunter Ronaldo
the Great, have come to eliminate you!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:57.380
Is that right?

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.260
He died!

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:02.180
"Surrender"

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:02.180
I'm sorry, I'm just a hornworm.
Please turn a blind eye.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:04.430
"Surrender"

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:04.430
My self-introduction three
shots ago was wasted!

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:08.890
Are you really Draluc?
You're not just a cosplaying tourist?

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:14.610
If that were the case, then you would
have killed a cosplaying tourist.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.360
Are you okay with that?

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.440
I am indeed the vampire, Draluc.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.070
"Vampire - Draluc"
I am indeed the vampire, Draluc.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:23.530
"Vampire - Draluc"
However, I am not the powerful being
you humans make me out to be.

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:26.870
Hey, what about the part where
you're an invincible progenitor?

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.160
That's...

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:29.200
"Invincible progenitor!"
"Castle Draluc Tour"

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.250
"Invincible progenitor!"
"Castle Draluc Tour"
...something a tour bus guide
made up that ended up spreading.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.750
...something a tour bus guide
made up that ended up spreading.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.460
You should deny stuff like that!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:35.670
But the locals believed it
and used it to revive the town.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:36.710
"Castle Draluc"

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:36.710
But the locals believed it
and used it to revive the town.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:37.670
"Invincible Progenitor Draluc Boxed Lunch"
"Castle Draluc"

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:37.670
But the locals believed it
and used it to revive the town.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:38.710
"Invincible Progenitor"

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:38.710
But the locals believed it
and used it to revive the town.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.920
"Invincible Progenitor Sablés"
"Invincible Progenitor"

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.920
But the locals believed it
and used it to revive the town.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.380
I can't really say anything
after all this time.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:45.600
In other words,
the real you is just a small fry.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.140
Are you mocking me?!

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:47.470
"NF 2"

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.640
"NF 2"

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.640
I'm really strong in fighting games.
Wanna try and fight me?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.100
I'm really strong in fighting games.
Wanna try and fight me?

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.390
No, I don't!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.560
What, you don't like fighting games?

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:57.110
Then, I've got Vamperman--

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.150
Sand...

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:02.490
On top of being super weak, you also
like weird stuff. There's no saving you!

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:04.490
What's with that unwarranted slander?

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.240
Don't play dumb, shotacon!

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:07.830
Hurry up and bring out
the boy you kidnapped!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:11.620
Who are you calling a shotacon?
I like pretty girls with beautiful napes!

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:14.170
Are you a lolicon, too?
You piece of trash!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.540
Those video games are bait to kidnap
kids, aren't they? You pervert!

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.880
It's not! They are purely my hobby!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:23.220
Hobby, as in, "Let's play
with my analog stick"?!

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.930
<i>You're </i>the pervert!

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.180
What are you doing, little boy?

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:27.220
QSQ.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.470
That's not what he's asking about.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:32.680
There're a ton of games here,
so I've been coming every day to play.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:33.890
<i>Every </i>day?!

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.400
Oh, since vampires sleep during the day.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.860
I <i>thought </i>there were a bunch
of extra save files...

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:40.730
You should've noticed, then.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:44.490
Today, it got late while I was
trying to clear the game.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:48.320
Do you think you can get away
with trespassing into my castle?

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.240
I am the vampire, Draluc!

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:53.120
Oh, yeah? You're uglier than I expected.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:55.080
Sand...

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.380
Man, what a letdown.
Come on, we're going home.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:01.420
Huh? No way. If I go home now,
I'll probably be yelled at a lot.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.970
No one's going to yell at you.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:07.550
Your mom was really worried about you.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:11.970
To a mother, her child is
always the most important.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:14.430
What do you know about my mom?

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:17.480
Shut up! I don't know anything, stupid!

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:21.270
Anyway, I'm not going
home yet! Later, guys!

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.230
Stop! You'll scratch up the floor!

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:24.820
Stop, kid!

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.530
You fool.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:30.410
Don't think you can beat me
in my own castle!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:33.040
Hey, wait! You're up against a kid here!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.080
Now, boy. Come quietl--

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.500
Sand...

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.710
Idiot!

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.420
That kid...

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.260
Where did he go, damn it?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.260
Hey, lead the way, stupid vampire!

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:52.010
Wait, I can still feel the pain in my leg.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:55.140
