00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.060
I thought it was the AC.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.400
So careless!

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.530
Damn it, this isn't the end of it!

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.280
Oh, he ran away.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.950
