00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.110
Sand...

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.610
Um, well... you know...

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.240
Dnas...

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.080
Life's full of ups and downs, right?

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:54.170
