00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:47.910
No thanks!

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.620
Also, John the Armadillo.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:50.080
John?!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.330
"John the Armadillo"

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.700
I guess you could call him my familiar.

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.040
He wasn't even in the castle!

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:00.460
Yes, he was. In that room
with all the traps.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.920
What the hell were you doing?!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:07.880
John's hard, so it's fine.

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:11.100
John, if you don't like something,
it's okay to say so!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:13.640
I'll take care of John. <i>You </i>get out!

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:15.980
What? Are you trying to tear apart
the bond between me and John?!

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:19.100
In the first place, <i>you're </i>the reason
my castle was destroyed!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:24.230
I'm going to press for damages!
QSQ! Castle! QSQ! John!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.320
Are you an idiot extortionist
or something?!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.450
It's part of a hunter's job to help
citizens in need, isn't it?

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:33.120
It's my job to kill guys
like you dead, too!

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:36.910
What are you saying?
There are all sorts of vampires.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.120
The ones that you all fight
are either inferior vampires

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:40.040
"Inferior Vampires"
The ones that you all fight
are either inferior vampires

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.420
"Inferior Vampires"
or the fellows that bear ill will toward
humans and want to harm them.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:46.010
Intelligent and friendly superior
vampires--in other words,

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:51.010
vampire lords like me--
can coexist with human society.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:53.470
So I'll be here starting today.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:58.020
You're stupid, harmful, and inferior!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.440
You're a target that should
be eliminated immediately!

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:03.650
W-Wait! Please stop with
the certain death set!

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:06.780
Whoa! Welcome!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.860
I need help, Ronaldo!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:12.070
You're the manager from Vanima, right?
What's the matter?

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:14.620
I'm embarrassed to say that my idiot son--

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.450
Excuse me, I'm going to trap
something behind the door.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:17.370
Sand...

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.620
Trap what?!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.540
I thought I caught a glimpse
of a person just now...

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.790
Just a part-time temp.
Don't worry about it.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:25.880
You trapped your temp worker
and crushed him?

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:30.180
Bastard, you slammed the door
on me not just once, but twice!

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.430
A vampire!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.720
Oh, um, that's because, uh--

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:37.640
After I defeated him, he had a change of
heart and said he wanted to work for me.

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:38.890
That's what happened!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.060
Hey, why am I a part-timer?

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.190
Shut up!

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:45.230
It doesn't matter. Both of you,
please come with me.

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:47.820
I told you, I need help. Seriously!

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:50.320
"Vamima!!!"
"Kalbi Bowl Fair!!"

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.700
"Vamima!!!"
"Kalbi Bowl Fair!!"
Get away from me!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:52.490
I'm gonna become a vampire.

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:54.120
"Manager's Son - Bubuo"
I'm gonna become a vampire.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:56.080
"Manager's Son - Bubuo"
I don't want any treatment!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.450
Calm down, Bubuo!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:01.080
Don't come near me! I'll bite her!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:04.080
What, just a pseudovampire?

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:07.550
It looks like he was just bitten
by an inferior vampire.

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:11.510
Yeah, he'll be fine with just
one shot from the hospital.

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:15.350
Even if you leave it alone, you won't
turn into a real vampire, you know.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:17.350
That's what I told him, too.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:20.350
Adults are all L-I-A-R-S!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:23.850
He's just been playing air guitar and
shouting like that this whole time.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.900
A troublesome idiot, huh?

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:28.570
If he hurts the part-timer,
Eri, it'll be bad!

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:30.860
Please talk him down somehow.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.650
I guess I have no choice.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:36.120
Hey! Why do you want
to be a vampire, anyway?

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:40.120
Huh?! I-Isn't it obvious?!

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:46.500
I wanna become a vampire...
a-and live for a long... um...

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.920
Freedom!

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.090
To graduate from society...

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:53.590
And be free somehow so I can say
bye to this convenience store!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.680
Your motivation's not very clear, is it?!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.350
But when I was young,

00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:01.560
I also tried to become a pole dancer
for no particular reason!

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:04.310
You should keep memories
like that to yourself!

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:08.060
You! Why do you want to become a vampire
when you're so unsure of yourself?!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.570
Look at this guy!

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.280
My cape's caught in the automatic door...

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.280
Are you a toddler?

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:15.530
Wh-What's up with that guy?

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.870
He's a vampire, like what you want to be.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:21.540
Hey there, I'm the vampire, Draluc.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.330
Huh...?

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.540
Hey.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:25.750
Huh...?

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:29.380
What the <i>hell</i>...?!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:34.170
Right now, you look like you just saw
the girl you like kissing an old man.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:38.550
What? A real vampire deigned to show
himself to you and you act so rudely?

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:42.140
It's because the real vampire
was dying like a drone beetle.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:47.520
But the plan to disillusion him and force
him to face reality seems to be working.

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:49.730
All right, Lord Dral.
Die in a more pathetic way.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.820
Why are you talking like
a heel in pro wrestlin--?

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.400
Sand...

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:56.320
A-A guy like that has
nothing to do with me!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:59.030
I'll become a stronger vampire than him!

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:01.160
Oh, is that so?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.000
But then you'll have nowhere to run!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:07.670
Because I, Vampire Hunter Ronaldo
the Great, will eliminate you!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.790
What?! You're Ronaldo?!

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:10.210
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:10.210
What?! You're Ronaldo?!

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.670
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.670
I read your autobiography.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.050
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.050
It was so good.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:16.550
Oh, do you want me to sign it?

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.180
Ronaldo!

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.680
Even after reading <i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>,

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.850
you still want to make
an enemy of hunters?!

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:26.560
Being able to fight hunters after
becoming a vampire gets me fired up!

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:29.350
Hey, why don't you let
your son do as he wish--?

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.860
Ronaldo!

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.860
Anyway! I <i>will </i>become a vampire!

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:36.530
You and my old man should
just get out of my way!

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:41.490
Indeed. Your ambition
should be respected.

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:44.080
Draluc, when did you--?

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:47.790
A pseudovampire cannot
become a full vampire.

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:52.670
However... I can give you what you desire.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:55.880
If you offer me your blood, that is.

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:59.680
I don't want to become
a weak vampire like you...

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:04.970
How strong you become...
What kind of ability you'll have...

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.930
It all depends on who you are.

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:11.860
What, are you losing your nerve?

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:15.150
Huh?! Don't make fun of me, bastard.

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.530
Fine, make me a vampire!

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.780
Stop, Draluc!

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.540
Sand...

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.620
Ack, a young man's blood is so rich!

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:34.500
I've been having milk for breakfast,
lunch, and dinner recently,

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.510
so my stomach was surprised
by such rich blood...

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:39.300
You should just quit being a vampire.

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:44.180
Damn it... So I can't become
a vampire after all?

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.390
That's what we've been trying to tell you.

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:50.690
I thought that if I became a vampire,
then I could convince Eri...

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:52.270
By Eri...?

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.730
You mean me?

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:58.690
Remember what you said when
I confessed my feelings to you?

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:03.700
Life's too short for you to
waste it on someone like me.

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:07.790
I don't want you to have regrets about me.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.870
I thought that if I became
a vampire with a longer life,

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:14.750
I could put you at ease!

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:19.760
Bubuo... I was trying
to turn you down gently.

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:23.090
I was just being nice to you
because you're the manager's son.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:26.640
But you're not my type at all.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:31.890
In the first place, going crazy and taking
me hostage is out of the question.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.350
Anyway, I'm quitting this month

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:37.480
to marry a rich guy
20 years older than me.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:44.360
Well, my shift's over,
so I'm leaving now, Manager.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:47.330
Huh? Uh, right...

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:52.910
I want to be a bird...

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:54.920
Live strong!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:56.920
Anyway, I guess this case is--

00:20:56.920 --> 00:21:00.420
I saw that, Ronaldo!

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:02.340
You took care of the
next job speedily, too!

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:04.800
And you were working with a vampire!

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:06.800
This is going to be big!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:09.720
Please let us write this up
in <i>Vampire Hunter Weekly</i>!

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.220
Wait, this is just--

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:14.100
Oh, can we get a comment, Mr. Manager?

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:18.570
I knew that it was their plan all along.

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:21.110
Don't get excited about
the press, Manager!

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:24.700
You could say that this
was resolved thanks to me.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:27.780
And what do you think <i>you're </i>saying?!

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.490
A comment from you, too, Ronaldo!

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:33.200
Teaming up with a vampire!
How did it start?

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.830
No, that's not--

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:38.040
Tell us your plans for the new
Ronaldo Vampire Hunter Agency

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:40.920
now that you've teamed up!

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:44.010
W-Well... um...

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:50.140
W-We'll <i>hunt </i>down any job you've got...

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:52.390
Yeah!

00:21:56.730 --> 00:21:57.650
"From the depths of darkness"

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:00.110
"Coming to you"

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:05.240
Bastard. You betrayed me,
didn't you, Draluc?!

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:08.410
Betraying hunters is what vampires do.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:16.080
The vampire dies in no time.
